      "value": "Honestly the main thing stopping me from prioritizing optimization is that its gonna be very poor anyways.\n\nI might eventually do it (though I do always optimize texture use) but for the most part I just rarely see the point if the rating is going to be very poor anyways.\n\nMay latest model I did optimize and everything is medium or good even in my least stripped down version of it but its very poor which just kind of demoralizes me to optimize anything unless I can make it good (which is maybe 1 out of 10 projects at most).",
