      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would prefer that polygon limits and other settings would be accumulated into an overall score, and you would be able to see how 'performant' your avatar is by taking a well weighted average score of each component. certain things like polygons would have a larger impact and ideally scale non-linearly, with materials being similar. though other things such as particles and GPU instanced objects maybe not. it is bizarre that a single light places you within the same performance bracket as someone with Poor in each individual category.",
